            "@type": "NewsArticle",
            "headline": "PayPal stakes AI-led turnaround on $1.5B in savings as it cuts jobs and rebuilds tech stack",
            "articleSection": "Job Evolution",
            "abstract": "PayPal has publicly committed to an AI-driven transformation strategy, tying automation initiatives to $1.5 billion in projected savings while simultaneously cutting workers and modernising its underlying technology infrastructure. CEO Alex Chriss described the shift as the company \"becoming a technology company again,\" framing AI as the engine of a broader reinvention. The announcement highlights a growing pattern among legacy fintech firms using AI efficiency narratives to justify headcount reductions.",
            "url": "https://techcrunch.com/2026/05/05/paypal-says-its-becoming-a-technology-company-again-that-means-ai/",
